  data: {
    LLM: '1. **Deal**: Ten cards each. 2. **Cambio**: Each player passes one card face down to the player on their right. 3. **Play**: Each turn, a player may take the card left by the previous player (if it fits a meld) or turn up a new card from the stock. 4. **Melding**: A card taken from the center must be melded immediately with cards from the hand or added to existing melds. It cannot be taken into the hand. 5. **Forcing**: Players can force an opponent to meld the center card if it fits their existing tableau. 6. **Winning**: First to meld an 11th card wins.',
    Player: '1. **Deal**: Ten cards each. 2. **Cambio**: Each player passes one card face down to the player on their right. 3. **Play**: Each turn, a player may take the card left by the previous player (if it fits a meld) or turn up a new card from the stock. 4. **Melding**: A card taken from the center must be melded immediately with cards from the hand or added to existing melds. It cannot be taken into the hand. 5. **Forcing**: Players can force an opponent to meld the center card if it fits their existing tableau. 6. **Winning**: First to meld an 11th card wins.',
    objective: "Be the first to meld 11 cards in valid combinations. The winner is paid by each opponent according to the 'pay cards' in the winner's melds.",
    gameplay: '1. **Deal**: Ten cards each. 2. **Cambio**: Each player passes one card face down to the player on their right. 3. **Play**: Each turn, a player may take the card left by the previous player (if it fits a meld) or turn up a new card from the stock. 4. **Melding**: A card taken from the center must be melded immediately with cards from the hand or added to existing melds. It cannot be taken into the hand. 5. **Forcing**: Players can force an opponent to meld the center card if it fits their existing tableau. 6. **Winning**: First to meld an 11th card wins.',
    keyRules: [
      'Valid melds: (1) Run of 3+ consecutive cards in the same suit (7 is adjacent to 10); (2) Set of 3+ identical cards (same rank and suit).',
      'Pay cards: 1, 3, 5, 7, 10, 12.',
      'Values: coins=1, cups=2, swords=3, batons=4 pesos per card.',
      'Cards from stock/discard can only be taken if immediately melded.',
    ],
