    turnFlow: '1. **Deal**: Ten cards each. 2. **Cambio**: Each player passes one card face down to the player on their right. 3. **Play**: Each turn, a player may take the card left by the previous player (if it fits a meld) or turn up a new card from the stock. 4. **Melding**: A card taken from the center must be melded immediately with cards from the hand or added to existing melds. It cannot be taken into the hand. 5. **Forcing**: Players can force an opponent to meld the center card if it fits their existing tableau. 6. **Winning**: First to meld an 11th card wins.',
